<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>403 — Acceso denegado</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;700&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/icon?family=Material+Icons" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/materialize/1.0.0/css/materialize.min.css">
  <style>
    :root {
      --ink: #0d0d0d;
      --cream: #f7f4ef;
      --gold: #c9a84c;
      --muted: #6b6560;
      --red: #b84040;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
      background: var(--ink);
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2rem;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    body::before {
      content: '403';
      position: fixed;
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 40vw;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
      top: 50%;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
      pointer-events: none;
      line-height: 1;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    /* decorative rings */
    .ring-1, .ring-2 {
      position: fixed;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.08);
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .ring-1 { width: 600px; height: 600px; top: -200px; right: -200px; }
    .ring-2 { width: 400px; height: 400px; bottom: -150px; left: -150px; }

    .error-logo {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
      margin-bottom: 4rem;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .error-logo span { color: var(--gold); }

    .shield-wrap {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .shield-wrap .material-icons {
      font-size: 3.5rem;
      color: rgba(184,64,64,0.7);
    }

    .error-code {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 7rem;
      color: #fff;
      line-height: 1;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .error-line {
      width: 50px;
      height: 2px;
      background: var(--red);
      margin: 0.8rem auto 1.5rem;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .error-title {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      color: #fff;
      margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .error-copy {
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 300;
      max-width: 300px;
      line-height: 1.9;
      margin: 0 auto 2.5rem;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .error-actions {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1rem;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: #fff;
      color: var(--ink);
      font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      padding: 0.8rem 1.8rem;
      border-radius: 2px;
      text-decoration: none;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.4rem;
      transition: background 0.2s, color 0.2s;
    }

    .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--gold); color: var(--ink); }
    .btn-primary .material-icons { font-size: 1rem; }

    .btn-secondary {
      background: transparent;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
      font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      padding: 0.8rem 1.8rem;
      border-radius: 2px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
      text-decoration: none;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.4rem;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }

    .btn-secondary:hover { border-color: var(--gold); color: var(--gold); }
    .btn-secondary .material-icons { font-size: 1rem; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="ring-1"></div>
  <div class="ring-2"></div>

  <div class="error-logo">Axis<span>.</span></div>

  <div class="shield-wrap">
    <i class="material-icons">gpp_bad</i>
  </div>

  <div class="error-code">403</div>
  <div class="error-line"></div>
  <div class="error-title">Acceso denegado</div>
  <p class="error-copy">No tienes permisos para ver este contenido. Contacta a un administrador si crees que es un error.</p>

  <div class="error-actions">
    <a href="/dashboard" class="btn-primary waves-effect">
      <i class="material-icons">home</i>
      Ir al inicio
    </a>
    <a href="javascript:history.back()" class="btn-secondary waves-effect">
      <i class="material-icons">arrow_back</i>
      Volver
    </a>
  </div>

  <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/materialize/1.0.0/js/materialize.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>